{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《金融時報》報道，黃仁勳在經歷11天的辭職風波後重新執掌英偉達，並承諾第二次擔任CEO會「做得更好」。然而，英<strong>偉達的員工、分析師和法律專家都在質疑，黃仁勳能否繼續以他過去的方式管理這家市值達3.6萬億美元的公司。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588208.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.154255+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:42:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"cccf363a545d423e1a8eb85a6995bde510961eb1a15b3f3edff6eeb0351e6802","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}